{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205430","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1520543001:0":{"text":"...하이! 왜 여기 있는 거냐. 전쟁터에 있으면 안 돼, 얼른 가거라! 짐승들이...","source_cn":"……高，你怎么在这里！你不应该上战场，快走！那些野兽会——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DC2EDAEF902877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520543002:0":{"text":"아버지, 전쟁은... 전부 끝났어요.","source_cn":"阿爹，战争……战争已经结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42E5796AF611E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520543003:0":{"text":"전쟁이, 끝났다고? 그러면 나는...","source_cn":"战争，结束了？我……那我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21EE42DC7C7001C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520543004:1":{"text":"왜... 짐승의 군주님의 품으로 돌아가지 못한 거지?","source_cn":"为什么，我没有回归兽群之主的怀抱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1663EE53EC7B64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520543005:1":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog127>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057B3D7C97663E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"